- `actor(a_default, "Default", [i1, n1, n2, n3, n4, n5, n6, n7, e1])`: Fails to reflect documented participant responsibilities; the source text explicitly assigns confirmation duties to the "client" and invoice delivery to "admin officers", yet all nodes are incorrectly grouped under a single generic actor instead of distinguishing these roles.